# Environments: variables come from gooseman.json next to this file (or any parent dir).
#   :Honk env dev      :Honk env staging      :Honk env none      :Honk env  (picker)
# Secrets go in gooseman.private.json (same shape, gitignored); it wins over gooseman.json.
# Note: an @var in the file wins over the environment, so don't also define @host here.
#
# Start the fake servers: python3 tests/echo_server.py  and  (cd tests/grpc_server && go run .)

# @header Authorization: Bearer {{login.body.token}}

### login with the environment's credentials
# @name login
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"user": "{{user}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

### which host am I hitting? ({{host}} changes with :Honk env)
GET {{host}}/whoami

### gRPC address comes from $shared
GRPC {{grpc}} grpc.health.v1.Health/Check

{"service": "goose"}
